# Line endings are LF everywhere. tools/32 hashes the raw bytes of translation/<id>.md, so a
# git operation that round-trips the working tree (stash, checkout, merge) under core.autocrlf
# rewrites those bytes and makes all 292 chunks read as "edited by hand" with no content change.
# That happened once during the restyle; this stops it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
